25/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used to write the exports

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

On the counterparty and the counter-case
----------------------------------------

The Rehearsal prompt asks for an LLM that improvises the other person, and Steelman asks for one
that writes the opposing case. There is no model and no key in this app: the counterparty is a
bundled script with a hidden goal, and the counter-case is a bundled bank of seven argument moves.
The scenario packs are written for Indian contexts (campus placement, rent negotiation) and are
ordinary conversational scripts, not claims about how any real interview or landlord behaves.
